    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shoes of Abhay, a teenage boy drawn into the heart of Koshir Village\u2014a forgotten place twisted by grief, guilt, and supernatural possession.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person, single-player psychological horror experience blends emotional storytelling with tense survival gameplay. Explore decaying homes, haunted forests, and long-buried secrets as you unravel a mystery rooted deep in Abhay\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying, possessed villagers in high-stakes encounters with limited ammo and resources. Make every shot count, manage your supplies carefully, and upgrade your tools to survive the escalating horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the Cult of Koshir Valley and their hidden syndicate while Abhay wrestles with the trauma of personal loss. Fight your way through with brute force\u2014or use stealth and strategy to navigate encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/f567a78e00f345635c2199291b6195ec.poster.avif?t=1753024423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/f567a78e00f345635c2199291b6195ec.webm?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/f567a78e00f345635c2199291b6195ec.mp4?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As the journey unfolds, reality begins to fracture. Abhay\u2019s past and present collide, twisted by the darkness manipulating his every step.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/ada2b35214c1b68ccf6d6ffe87d2ebf2.poster.avif?t=1753024423\" width=800 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/ada2b35214c1b68ccf6d6ffe87d2ebf2.webm?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/ada2b35214c1b68ccf6d6ffe87d2ebf2.mp4?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience a gripping, cinematic descent into psychological horror\u2014where survival is just the beginning, and redemption may come at a terrible cost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/ezgif-42d902e5e7235e.gif?t=1753024423\" width=800 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Featuring a reactive world where emotional and psychological tension shape your experience, every step forward changes what you see, hear, and feel. The darkness remembers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/66c2bf7cf4b575a0c9723415be842e2f.poster.avif?t=1753024423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/66c2bf7cf4b575a0c9723415be842e2f.webm?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/66c2bf7cf4b575a0c9723415be842e2f.mp4?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Currently in development for PC using Unity HDRP, with console releases planned. Perfect for fans of immersive horror, psychological storytelling, and narrative-rich gameplay experiences.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the shoes of Abhay, a teenage boy drawn into the heart of Koshir Village\u2014a forgotten place twisted by grief, guilt, and supernatural possession.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person, single-player psychological horror experience blends emotional storytelling with tense survival gameplay. Explore decaying homes, haunted forests, and long-buried secrets as you unravel a mystery rooted deep in Abhay\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying, possessed villagers in high-stakes encounters with limited ammo and resources. Make every shot count, manage your supplies carefully, and upgrade your tools to survive the escalating horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the Cult of Koshir Valley and their hidden syndicate while Abhay wrestles with the trauma of personal loss. Fight your way through with brute force\u2014or use stealth and strategy to navigate encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/f567a78e00f345635c2199291b6195ec.poster.avif?t=1753024423\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/f567a78e00f345635c2199291b6195ec.webm?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715210/extras/f567a78e00f345635c2199291b6195ec.mp4?t=1753024423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>As the journey unfolds, reality begins to fracture. Abhay\u2019s past and present collide, twisted by the darkness manipulating his every step.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop